  "slug": "sweet-and-nutty-moroccan-couscous",
  "name": "Sweet and Nutty Moroccan Couscous",
  "recipe_type": "dessert",
  "brief_description": "I've simplified this recipe for couscous mesfouf without losing any of its deliciously complex flavor. Prepare all the mix-ins ahead of time and it takes only minutes to make. Enjoy!",
  "cuisine": "Moroccan",
  "instructions": [
    {
      "position": 1,
      "text": "Pour the vegetable broth into a large saucepan, and bring to a boil. Add the butter, apricots, dates and raisins. Boil for 2 to 3 minutes. Remove from the heat, and stir in the couscous. Cover, and let stand for 5 minutes. Stir in the cinnamon and toasted almonds, and serve."
    }
  ],
  "servings": 6,
  "cooking_time_minutes": 5,
